  displayName: Stahl Colossus
  role: 2
  description: 'The Draksa Reich''s war machine: a humanoid robot twice a man''s
    height, with 15 health and Armor Level 3 that rifles, pistols and grenades can''t
    dent. Its Stabilizers let its Machine Gun (5 shots) fire even after moving, and
    when an enemy is within 2 m it can strike with its Iron Claw instead (Damage
    10, +25% accuracy). Mechanical: it moves 15 m but can''t sprint. Rockets and
    tank cannons are its bane. Heavy Support, so you can field more than one.'
